6. Billing and money
   Connect: Stripe, QuickBooks, Xero, Square, PayPal, Wave.
   First use: overdue invoice review, billing questions, payment links.

7. Chat and meetings
   Connect: Slack, Teams, iMessage/exports, WhatsApp/exports, Otter, Read AI, Granola.
   First use: pull action items and draft follow-ups.

8. Website, content, marketing, and socials
